  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5705.03 Positive Identification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5705.03 Positive Identification.\n\n(a) Fingerprints of the individual whose criminal history record is sought shall be submitted with all requests for criminal history record checks for noncriminal justice purposes.\n\n(b) In addition to the fees established in Saf-C 5703.06, the division shall also collect the fee as set forth in Saf-C 5704.06(b) below, involving fingerprint processing for noncriminal justice purposes.\n\nSource. #8173, eff 9-21-04; amd by #9329, eff 11-21-08; ss by #10208, eff 10-22-12; ss by #12132, eff 3-17-17; renumbered by #12606 (formerly Saf-C 5704.03)",
